easy-lyrics third-party attributions
=====================================

easy-lyrics serves lyrics from its own catalogue: one database that
contributors write to through signed-in accounts and an admin reviews. No
external lyrics service is queried at request time. Lyrics belong to their
publishers and songwriters; every API response carries `source` and
`sourceUrl` so credit travels with the data.

When bootstrapping a fresh instance, open databases such as LRCLIB
(https://lrclib.net) publish dumps that make convenient seed data; their
licenses and terms apply to whatever you import.

